# Do-not-touch

## Context

`app/src/store.ts` and `app/src/types.ts` are load-bearing core; changes there
ripple everywhere.

## Rule

- Don't edit `store.ts`, or change existing signatures in `types.ts` or
  `lib/text.ts`, without explicit user approval.
- Adding a new `Action` variant is fine; changing an existing one is not.

## How to verify

1. `git diff app/src/store.ts` is empty (unless explicitly approved).
2. `git diff app/src/types.ts` / `app/src/lib/text.ts` only shows additions,
   no changed existing signatures.
